{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/110788-question-on-building-pledges","id":110788,"title":"Question on building pledges","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-11T07:48:29-07:00","id":110788,"title":"Question on building pledges","content":"Is there a limit to the number of Boons that can appear in a pledge, beyond making sure that everything balances out with sanctions etc? And can a Boon be included more than once?<br /> For example the Adroitness Boon. It gives +1 to a skill. Can Adroitness be included in a pledge more than once, to give +1 to several different skills? Can it be included more than once to give a particular skill +3 instead of just +1?<br /> I wonder about all the boons. Can you give several forms of Blessing? And Ensorcellment, could someone make a pledge with a Changeling to grant not just himself ensorcellment, but his child the gift too? Two ensorcellments?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2557-sloanathan","name":"Sloanathan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T09:41:55-07:00","id":110858,"title":"","content":"Androitness explicitly states that it can not stack with itself - it only every provides +1 - but it can be attained for different skills. Also, every person bound by the Pledge has to agree to it (at least using the Core rules). Apart from that, I believe that the answer to your other questions is &quot;whatever the storyteller will allow&quot;. I am playing a Changeling currently which gained androitness to 8 skills from a single pledge, and gave the other party 4 points of Boons on top of it (and that's one of her 6 Pledges). As far as I'm aware, the only rule, as far as that goes, is that Pledges have to balance out to zero. One of the things that restricts them, though, is how well you can balance the Tasks with everything else going on, so I'd find it appropriate if a storyteller made really potent pledges require multiple tasks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T11:11:54-07:00","id":110933,"title":"","content":"Okay, here's another question: Is there anything preventing two changelings from making multiple pledges with one another, where each of three different pledges grant Adroitness to the same skill? Three different pledges with your sister to gain +1 to Academics from each pledge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2557-sloanathan","name":"Sloanathan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T21:12:19-07:00","id":111229,"title":"","content":"Yes there is - because no matter how many Adroitnesses you take for a skill, you can only ever gain +1 to it. You also couldn't take two pledges, one with a +3 resources boon and the other with a +2 resources boon, to gain 5-dot resources. <br /> <br /> Generally, pledge boons don't stack with themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}